---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
One person's page: how you know them, every topic, and the selected topic as a conversation of what each message newly says

Usage: mxr messages person [OPTIONS] <PERSON>

Arguments:
  <PERSON>  An address, or a row id from `mxr messages --format ids`

Options:
      --topic <THREAD_ID>  The conversation to show, by thread id. Defaults to the one whose turn it is, else the latest
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
